====== AUKEY WF-R8 ======
The AUKEY WF-R8 is an AC1200 WiFi range extender based on the [[docs:techref:hardware:soc:soc.mediatek|MediaTek MT7628AN]] with two Fast Ethernet ports, a 802.11n 2T/2R 2.4 GHz 300Mbps and a 802.11ac 2T/2R 5 GHz 867 Mbps wireless interfaces.

