===== Stock firmware =====
The WF-R8 ships with a Linux 2.6 kernel. It features a web interface through lighttpd and a telnet open on port 2323 or 23.

The web interface is very simple, although it does not offer much options.

Configuration files can also be modified using telnet, but the modifications will be erased upon reboot. Permanent changes must be done by modifying values stored in NVRAM, using the tool ''ralink_init''.

