==== LEDs ====
FIXME //Investigate if/how the other four LEDs work.//

The WF-R8 has seven leds. Three of them show the signal strength of the repeated wlan and come preconfigured in the system. However, they don't light up in the default installation. In order to make them work, the package ''rssileds'' must be installed.

Details on how to configure the LEDs can be found here: [[docs:guide-user:base-system:led_configuration|LED configuration /etc/config/system]].

